# Project policy

Read and follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

Before finishing work that touches `src/main/`:

1. Add or update matching tests under `src/test/`.
2. Run `./gradlew test` or `./gradlew check` and fix failures.

Use `./gradlew runServer` only for manual smoke tests, not as a substitute for unit tests.
